          "title": "Macao",
          "subtitle": "Gambling",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Macao is an old European gambling card game related to Baccarat, played with French cards and banking-style comparison."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Macao was first mentioned in 1774 and may have originated in Hungary or Italy. It became known in Europe as a gambling game related to Baccarat and other banking comparison games."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
